<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Learn to construct artificial ecosystems, highly advanced terraria which vastly improve upon hydroponics.-->
  <VFE_Res_AdvancedHydroponics.description>学习建造人工生态系统，高度先进的陆地动物，极大地改善了水培法。</VFE_Res_AdvancedHydroponics.description>
  <VFE_Res_AdvancedHydroponics.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->pioneering biospheres-->
    <li>subject-&gt;开创性生物圈</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->conceived and created self-sustaining environments, mastering the balance of nature and technology-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;构思并创建了自我维持的环境，掌握了自然与技术的平衡</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->ushered in a new age of food security with ecosystems that defy the natural limitations of climate and geography-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;开创了粮食安全的新时代，其生态系统突破了气候和地理的自然限制</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->harnessed the principles of ecological harmony, integrating advanced hydroponics with biodiverse terraria-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;利用生态和谐的原则，将先进的水培法与生物多样性的陆地环境相结合</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->enabled the cultivation of exotic flora and fauna, previously unseen on this scale-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;实现了外来动植物的培育，规模之大是前所未见的</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->innovated in closed-loop water and nutrient cycles, reducing waste and increasing efficiency-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;在闭环水和养分循环方面进行创新，减少浪费并提高效率</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->revolutionizing agriculture with the creation of artificial ecosystems-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;通过创建人工生态系统彻底改变农业</li>
  </VFE_Res_AdvancedHydroponics.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: artificial ecosystems-->
  <VFE_Res_AdvancedHydroponics.label>人工生态系统</VFE_Res_AdvancedHydroponics.label>
  <!--EN: Develop a theoretical basis for larger-scale farming operations, including centralized feeding and dedicated scarecrows to keep your crops uneaten.-->
  <VFE_Res_FarmingTechniques.description>为大规模农业经营奠定理论基础，包括集中饲喂和专用稻草人以确保农作物不被吃掉。</VFE_Res_FarmingTechniques.description>
  <VFE_Res_FarmingTechniques.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->cultivating abundance-->
    <li>subject-&gt;培育丰富</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->rediscovered and refined ancient methods for modern largescale farming operations-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;重新发现和完善现代大规模农业经营的古代方法</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->implemented centralized feeding strategies, optimizing nutrition and yield-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;实施集中饲喂策略，优化营养和产量</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->crafted scarecrows based on deep understanding of local fauna, effectively protecting crops-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;深入了解当地动物，精心制作稻草人，有效保护农作物</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->laid down the foundational practices for sustainable and efficient food production-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;制定了可持续和高效粮食生产的基本做法</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->inspired a generation of farmers to adopt innovative approaches to agriculture-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;激励一代农民采用创新的农业方法</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->advancing the art and science of farming through cutting-edge techniques-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;通过尖端技术推进农业艺术和科学</li>
  </VFE_Res_FarmingTechniques.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: farming techniques-->
  <VFE_Res_FarmingTechniques.label>耕作技术</VFE_Res_FarmingTechniques.label>
  <!--EN: Assemble schematics for a device which can automatically water fields, increasing the speed at which crops grow.-->
  <VFE_Res_Sprinkler.description>组装一个可以自动给田地浇水、提高农作物生长速度的设备的原理图。</VFE_Res_Sprinkler.description>
  <VFE_Res_Sprinkler.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->the irrigation evolution-->
    <li>subject-&gt;灌溉演变</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->developed automated watering systems, ensuring optimal hydration for crops across vast fields-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;开发了自动浇水系统，确保大面积作物的最佳水合作用</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->transformed agricultural productivity with precision irrigation, minimizing water waste-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;通过精准灌溉改变农业生产力，最大限度地减少水资源浪费</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->pioneered the use of sprinklers, marking a leap forward from traditional watering methods-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;率先使用喷头，标志着传统浇水方法的飞跃</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->empowered farmers to control the very essence of growth - water - with the turn of a valve-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;使农民能够通过转动阀门来控制生长的本质 - 水</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->fostered greener pastures and bountiful harvests, even in areas once thought barren-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;培育更绿的牧场和丰收，即使是在曾经被认为贫瘠的地区</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->streamlining growth with the simplicity and efficiency of sprinklers-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;利用喷头的简单性和效率来简化增长</li>
  </VFE_Res_Sprinkler.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: sprinklers-->
  <VFE_Res_Sprinkler.label>洒水器</VFE_Res_Sprinkler.label>
</LanguageData>
